SLOW CANALIZATION MEMORY
to be relearned.

This is a major architectural improvement.

WHY SLOW MEMORY STILL ERODES
If M never changed,
a region exposed to:
persistent long-term volatility

would remain:
permanently predisposed to strong specialization

and repeatedly recrystallize whenever fast suppression briefly fell.

Allowing:
persistent volatility

to slowly erode M
prevents that.

Thus:

FAST SUPPRESSION
handles:
surprise.

SLOW MEMORY
handles:
developmental regime.

